********************************************************************************
* ID: a:40: Unique identifier for DGS file
* loc_name: a:40: Name
* fold_id: p: In Folder
* uline: r: Rated Voltage in kV
* sline: r: Rated Apparent Power in MVA
* aohl_: a:3: Installation Type: OHL:CAB
* rline: r: Positive-Sequence Resistance in Ohm/km
* xline: r: Positive-Sequence Reactance in Ohm/km
* cline: r: Positive-Sequence Capacitance in uF/km
* rline0: r: Zero-Sequence Resistance in Ohm/km
* xline0: r: Zero-Sequence Reactance in Ohm/km
* cline0: r: Zero-Sequence Capacitance in uF/km
* rtemp: r: Reference Temperature in degC
* Ithr: r: Thermal Current Rating in kA
* chr_name: a:20: Characteristic Name
* nlnph: i: Phases:1:2:3
* nneutral: i: Number of Neutral Conductors
* for_name: a:50: Foreign Key
* InomAir: r: Continuous Current Rating in Air in kA
* cohl_: i: Conductor Arrangement Code
* tmax: r: Maximum Conductor Temperature in degC
* systp: i: System Type Code
* frnom: r: Nominal Frequency in Hz
* mlei: a:2: Line Model Type Code
* bline: r: Positive-Sequence Susceptance in uS/km
* bline0: r: Zero-Sequence Susceptance in uS/km
********************************************************************************
