$$TypSym;ID(a:40);loc_name(a:40);fold_id(p);sgn(r);ugn(r);cosn(r);xd(r);xq(r);xdsss(r);rstr(r);xdsat(r);satur(i);Q_min(r);Q_max(r);q_min(r);q_max(r);for_name(a:50);nphase(i);nslty(i);x0sy(r);r0sy(r);x2sy(r);r2sy(r);iopt_data(i);xds(r);xqs(r);xl(r);xdss(r);xqss(r);xrlq(r);tds(r);tqs(r);tdss(r);tqss(r)
********************************************************************************
* ID: a:40: Unique identifier for DGS file
* loc_name: a:40: Name
* fold_id: p: In Folder
* sgn: r: Rated Apparent Power in MVA
* ugn: r: Rated voltage in kV
* cosn: r: Rated Power Factor
* xd: r: Synchronous d-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xq: r: Synchronous q-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xdsss: r: Subtransient d-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* rstr: r: Stator Resistance in p.u.
* xdsat: r: Saturated d-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* satur: i: Magnetic Saturation Enabled
* Q_min: r: Minimum Reactive Power Capability in MVAr
* Q_max: r: Maximum Reactive Power Capability in MVAr
* q_min: r: Minimum Reactive Power Limit in MVAr
* q_max: r: Maximum Reactive Power Limit in MVAr
* for_name: a:50: Foreign Key
* nphase: i: Number of Phases
* nslty: i: Neutral Grounding Type Code
* x0sy: r: Zero-Sequence Reactance in p.u.
* r0sy: r: Zero-Sequence Resistance in p.u.
* x2sy: r: Negative-Sequence Reactance in p.u.
* r2sy: r: Negative-Sequence Resistance in p.u.
* iopt_data: i: Machine Data Option Code
* xds: r: Transient d-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xqs: r: Transient q-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xl: r: Leakage Reactance in p.u.
* xdss: r: Subtransient d-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xqss: r: Subtransient q-Axis Reactance in p.u.
* xrlq: r: q-Axis Damper Leakage Reactance in p.u.
* tds: r: Transient Open-Circuit Time Constant Tdo' in s
* tqs: r: Transient Open-Circuit Time Constant Tqo' in s
* tdss: r: Subtransient Open-Circuit Time Constant Tdo'' in s
* tqss: r: Subtransient Open-Circuit Time Constant Tqo'' in s
********************************************************************************
